### Consulta de clientes
GET http://api.sistemasexto/clientes

### Consulta de cliente por ID
GET http://api.sistemasexto/clientes/1

### Adicionar cliente
POST http://api.sistemasexto/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ci": "12345678",
    "nombre": "Ana",
    "apellidos": "Lopez",
    "direccion": "Calle Principal 123",
    "telefono": "70000000"
}

### Modificar cliente
PUT http://api.sistemasexto/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ci": "12345678",
    "nombre": "Ana Maria",
    "apellidos": "Lopez",
    "direccion": "Calle Principal 456",
    "telefono": "70000000"
}

### Eliminar cliente
DELETE http://api.sistemasexto/clientes/1
